[h1]PZ Butter[/h1]
PZ Butter makes Project Zomboid Build 42 run smoother. It is one mod that covers the work of many performance mods: sound, lighting, wall cutaways, weather, zombie updates, vehicles, UI redraws, texture memory and loading. It works out of the box: subscribe, enable, play. Every feature has a switch in Options > Mods, and anything you switch off runs the way the game normally does.

